{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1304849-cutting-shadow-shadow-weaving","id":1304849,"title":"Cutting Shadow / Shadow Weaving","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-14T11:51:13-07:00","id":1304849,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Cutting Shadow / Shadow Weaving","content":"I'm not that fond of W20 and play revised most of the time.<br /> <br /> Lately in a W20 game the question arose,: Can a Shadow Lord stretch the shadow of an enemy severeal dozened meters away to his own position with Shadow Weaving, and then use it to attack over a basically huge distance?<br /> <br /> Shadow Weaving has no limit given to what degree a shadow can be twisted, only a maximum distance from user to shadow, which is 199ft./91m....<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-14T13:22:13-07:00","id":1304869,"title":"","content":"It's possible. But, you'd likely need to be able to perceive the target first. I don't think it lets you know every shadow within the area instinctively. But, if you were a ways away from the target but able to see them, or could see them through a camera and knew they were close-by, I think you could do so. The character may notice the shadow stretching, though, and may try to flee beyond the area.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1407-endlesskng","name":"EndlessKng","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-15T07:11:15-07:00","id":1305035,"title":"","content":"As a combo yes you can do that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}